// Template for Iris/Secrets.swift (which is git-ignored).
// Copy this file to Iris/Secrets.swift and paste your real values below:
//
//     cp Iris/Secrets.swift.example Iris/Secrets.swift
//
// (A build copies this template there automatically if it's missing, so the app still runs: without a
// real key every line is spoken by the on-device voice, and without an agent ID there's no agent.)
//
// The API key starts with "sk_" and is shown only when it is created or rotated. The key
// list in the dashboard shows each key's *id* instead — a bare 64-character hex string
// that looks like a key and is rejected by every request, which reads as the whole app
// going silent (see Speaker.fetchAudio).
//
// The agent ID is the public ElevenLabs agent the Locate hand-off and Explore talk to. It needs no key
// of its own; the SDK trades it for a connection token without authenticating.
//
// The voice ID is the agent's Primary voice (agent page → Voices → the voice's ⋯ menu → Copy voice ID),
// so the app's own lines and the agent speak in the same voice.

enum Secrets {
    static let elevenLabsAPIKey = "sk_PASTE_YOUR_ELEVENLABS_KEY_HERE"
    static let elevenLabsAgentID = "PASTE_YOUR_ELEVENLABS_AGENT_ID_HERE"
    static let elevenLabsVoiceID = "PASTE_YOUR_VOICE_ID_HERE"
}
